# elm-m3e build output — a workspace-level backstop.
#
# packages/elm-m3e/.gitignore and packages/elm-m3e/docs/.gitignore (both copied
# from the source repo, both tracked) already cover every path below. They are
# repeated here because those two files are VENDORED: they travel with elm-m3e
# and can change out from under this workspace, and the M2.a round-1 defect was
# 7747 files of docs/dist/** landing in this tree. This block keeps them out of
# version control regardless of what the vendored ignore files say.
#
# tools/copy-fidelity-elm-m3e.sh is the active check (it fails on these files
# being PRESENT, not merely tracked); this is the passive one.
packages/elm-m3e/dist/
packages/elm-m3e/dist-packages/
packages/elm-m3e/docs.json
packages/elm-m3e/docs/dist/
packages/elm-m3e/docs/functions/
packages/elm-m3e/docs/test-results/
packages/elm-m3e/docs/playwright-report/
packages/elm-m3e/docs/.playwright/
packages/elm-m3e/docs/data/reference.json
packages/elm-m3e/docs/data/rule-roundtrip-report.json
packages/elm-m3e/docs/public/style.css
packages/elm-m3e/docs/public/m3e.js
packages/elm-m3e/docs/app/Route/RoundtripHarness.elm
